{"lines": ["A military radar scope tracked an unknown target over England at up to four thousand miles per hour.", "August thirteenth, nineteen fifty-six. A C-Forty-Seven pilot and ground observers saw a fast white light.", "At Lakenheath, golf-ball-sized lights shrank to pinpoints.", "The Royal Air Force sent a Venom fighter to intercept.", "But watch supervisor Forrest Perkins wrote that the target whipped behind the fighter and shadowed it for ten minutes.", "He said the frightened pilot tried everything to shake it.", "A classified teleprinter message three days later broadly agreed.", "Yet the Venom crews later told researchers they saw only a stationary blip, and no chase.", "Skeptics blamed Perseid meteors and false echoes. The Condon Report called a genuine unknown fairly probable.", "So did false returns fool the watch room, or did something outfly a jet on that military radar scope?"], "words": [["A", 0.0, 0.08], ["military", 0.08, 0.32], ["radar", 0.32, 0.82], ["scope", 0.82, 1.22], ["tracked", 1.22, 1.58], ["an", 1.58, 1.84], ["unknown", 1.84, 2.1], ["target", 2.1, 2.56], ["over", 2.56, 2.9], ["England", 2.9, 3.16], ["at", 3.16, 3.44], ["up", 3.44, 3.58], ["to", 3.58, 3.7], ["four", 3.7, 3.973], ["thousand", 3.973, 4.52], ["miles", 4.52, 4.72], ["per", 4.72, 5.02], ["hour.", 5.02, 5.3], ["August", 5.74, 5.96], ["thirteenth,", 5.96, 6.56], ["nineteen", 6.56, 7.04], ["fifty-six.", 7.04, 7.52], ["A", 8.34, 8.38], ["C-Forty-Seven", 8.38, 9.24], ["pilot", 9.24, 9.48], ["and", 9.48, 9.92], ["ground", 9.92, 10.16], ["observers", 10.16, 10.58], ["saw", 10.58, 11.18], ["a", 11.18, 11.24], ["fast", 11.24, 11.62], ["white", 11.62, 11.9], ["light.", 11.9, 12.22], ["At", 12.72, 12.78], ["Lakenheath,", 12.78, 13.545], ["golf-ball-sized", 13.545, 14.54], ["lights", 14.54, 14.9], ["shrank", 14.9, 15.46], ["to", 15.46, 15.68], ["pinpoints.", 15.68, 16.12], ["The", 16.68, 16.74], ["Royal", 16.74, 16.94], ["Air", 16.94, 17.3], ["Force", 17.3, 17.54], ["sent", 17.54, 17.88]